{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02852","headline":"渡汉江 · 李百药","name":"渡汉江","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东流既弥弥，南纪信滔滔。\n水激沈碑岸，波骇弄珠皐。\n含星映浅石，浮盖下奔涛。\n溜阔霞光近，川长晓气高。\n樯乌转轻翼，戏鸟落风毛。\n客心既多绪，长歌且代劳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李百药","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02852.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02852","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}